# Repo-local exceptions to the system /etc/.gitignore rule "*.log".
#
# The NMB3 autonomous loop's audit trail of Steve decisions lives in
# nmb3/nmb3_decisions.log and MUST be canonical: the objective map's
# evidence pointers reference it explicitly, and the autonomous loop
# policy requires every Steve string to be quoted verbatim there.
# The system /etc/.gitignore rule "*.log" would otherwise silently
# drop it on `git add` (caught at canonical commit 33e533d, fixed
# in the immediate follow-up).
!nmb3/nmb3_decisions.log
